@startuml
title EduReserve Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
top to bottom direction

component "EduReserve\nApplication entry point" as App #FFF2CC
component "UI\nUi, Parser, HelpText" as UI #DAE8FC
component "Commands\nBook, List, Free, etc." as Commands #E1D5E7
component "Model\nBooking, BookingList,\nVenueCatalog" as Model #D5E8D4
component "Storage" as Storage #F8CECC
artifact "Data files\nbookings.txt, username.txt" as Files #F5F5F5

App --> UI : processes input
App --> Storage : loads and saves data
App --> Model : holds booking list

UI --> Commands : executes commands
UI --> Model : reads and updates bookings

Commands --> Model : reads and updates bookings
Storage --> Model : loads and saves bookings
Storage --> Files : reads and writes

@enduml